meta {
  name: List users
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

params:query {
  page: 1
  limit: 10
  ~sort: id
  ~order: desc
  ~search: a
  ~roleId: 1
  ~status: blocked
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # List users

  Store users — customers and administrators. `password` is write-only: it is hashed with bcrypt and never returned. Users created here are ACTIVE immediately. The role is returned inline as `role: { id, name, code }`.

  Returns one page of active users. Soft-deleted records never appear.

  ## Auth

  Bearer token of a user whose role is `ADMIN` (send **auth/Log in** first; it stores `{{token}}`).

  ## Query parameters

  | Name | Type | Required | Notes |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `page` | integer | no | 1-based page; default 1. A page past the end returns `data: []` with correct `pagination`. |
  | `limit` | integer | no | Page size; default 10; values above 100 are clamped to 100. |
  | `sort` | string | no | One of: id, name, lastName, email, createdAt. Default `id`. |
  | `order` | string | no | `asc` or `desc`; default `desc`. |
  | `search` | string | no | Case-insensitive match against: name, lastName, email, document. |
  | `roleId` | integer | no | Only users with this role. |
  | `status` | `active` \| `blocked` \| `pending` | no | Only accounts in this state (`status` 1, 2 or -2). |

  ## Responses

  ### 200 OK

    {
      "message": "User list",
      "data": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "roleId": 2,
          "genderId": 4,
          "documentTypeId": 1,
          "name": "Ada",
          "lastName": "Lovelace",
          "email": "ada@lpaecomms.test",
          "document": "PA1234567",
          "phone": "+61 400 000 000",
          "address": "1 Cavill Ave, Surfers Paradise QLD",
          "emailVerified": false,
          "session": null,
          "deletedAt": null,
          "role": {
            "id": 2,
            "name": "Customer",
            "code": "CUSTOMER"
          },
          "created": {
            "client": "2026-09-27T02:30:14.000Z",
            "server": "2026-09-27T02:30:14.000Z",
            "serverDate": "2026-09-27",
            "serverTime": "12:30:14",
            "unixTime": 1790476214,
            "user": 1,
            "role": "ADMIN"
          },
          "updated": null,
          "statusName": "ACTIVE",
          "status": 1,
          "createdAt": "2026-09-27T02:30:14.000Z",
          "updatedAt": "2026-09-27T02:30:14.000Z"
        }
      ],
      "pagination": {
        "total": 1,
        "page": 1,
        "limit": 10,
        "totalPages": 1,
        "count": 1,
        "hasNextPage": false,
        "hasPrevPage": false
      }
    }

  ### 400 Bad Request — validation failed

  A paging, sort or filter parameter is invalid (e.g. `page=0`, an unknown `sort`).

    {
      "message": "Some fields need attention.",
      "data": null,
      "pagination": null,
      "errors": [
        {
          "field": "page",
          "message": "Invalid input"
        }
      ]
    }

  ### 401 Unauthorized — missing, invalid or expired token

    {
      "message": "Sign in to continue.",
      "data": null,
      "pagination": null,
      "errors": []
    }

  ### 403 Forbidden — the token's role is not ADMIN

    {
      "message": "You do not have permission to do this.",
      "data": null,
      "pagination": null,
      "errors": []
    }

  Outside production, error bodies also carry `stack`.
}
